    The billing cycle frequency will be once per week. You do not need to subscribe
    to use this app. Payment will be charged to your Google Play account upon confirmation
    of the transaction or at the end of any trial period, if applicable. The subscription
    will automatically renew unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before
    the end of the current period. You can manage and disable the auto-renewal feature
    by going to your account settings on Google Play after purchase.

